SUMMARY:Corey Holcomb LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nCorey Holcomb is a stand-up comedy genius whose comedy transcends class and racial divides\, known for his hilarious and brutally honest takes on relationships\, gender dynamics\, and everyday life. \nHe hit his first open mic in 1992 and has been a full-time comedian ever since\, taking top honors at the Miller Genuine Draft Comedy Search\, Budweiser Comedy Competition\, and Laffapalooza. He has appeared at the Montreal Just for Laughs Festival and the Chicago Comedy Festival. \nCorey’s television and film credits include NBC’s The Tonight Show\, MTV2’s Wild ‘N Out\, NBC’s Last Comic Standing\, HBO’s Def Comedy Jam\, Tyler Perry’s House of Pain\, Fox’s The Cleveland Show\, and three of his own comedy specials on Comedy Central and Showtime. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nAdditional Shows: Also performing July 31 (9:30 PM)\, August 1 (7:00 PM & 9:30 PM)\nFood & Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco\, just inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \nThe intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so guests can enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first come\, first served by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. \nLOL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club network\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring comedians to San Antonio. \nWhat to Expect\nCorey Holcomb delivers a full headlining stand-up set that is both an auditory and visual experience — his facial gestures alone can make an audience burst with laughter. \nExpect sharp\, unfiltered relationship comedy that offers plenty of advice\, observations\, and remedies delivered with Corey’s signature candid style. His comedy is relatable to people all over the world who understand the drama of making relationships work. \nThis is an 18+ event with adult-oriented\, unfiltered material. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy the full club experience with food and drinks before the show. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $40 – $62 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through official and resale channels: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-holcomb-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/73_Edp-KkINC5.png
GEO:29.5193054;-98.5060363
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club 618 Northwest Loop 410 San Antonio TX 78216 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=618 Northwest Loop 410:geo:-98.5060363,29.5193054
END:VEVENT
