SUMMARY:Steve-O: Crash & Burn LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nSteve-O: Crash & Burn LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nThe legendary Steve-O is bringing his outrageous  stand-up tour to Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco for a night of wild\, unfiltered comedy. Best known as a founding member of the Jackass franchise\, Steve-O has reinvented himself as a stand-up comedian\, delivering brutally honest and hilarious stories from his extraordinary life. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: Two-drink minimum per person \nAbout Steve-O\nSteve-O (Stephen Gilchrist Glover) is a comedian\, stunt performer\, and television personality best known for his work on MTV’s Jackass franchise. After years of wild stunts and personal struggles\, Steve-O has emerged as a compelling stand-up comedian\, sharing his incredible life story with raw honesty and humor. His  tour showcases his evolution from daredevil to storyteller\, delivering laughs that only someone who has truly lived on the edge can provide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy featuring Steve-O’s signature outrageous humor\nWild\, unfiltered stories from his life as a Jackass star and beyond\nAn intimate club setting at the legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDoors open one hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar service with a two-drink minimum per person\nAn unforgettable Friday night out in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s premier comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. The club has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and offers an intimate atmosphere with excellent sightlines from every seat. Street parking is available nearby\, and the venue is accessible via public transit. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $56 and are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). Ticket prices may vary based on availability. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled or postponed. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/steve-o-crash-burn-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/3a0b7475-c977-4e81-b1fc-59db47cf11e9_1480271_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9-LKrm7I.jpg
GEO:37.8029543;-122.4143041
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Cobb’s Comedy Club 915 Columbus Avenue San Francisco California 94133 United States Of America;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=915 Columbus Avenue:geo:-122.4143041,37.8029543
END:VEVENT
