SUMMARY:Chris O'Connor LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nChris O’Connor is a fast-rising stand-up comedian who has been making waves on the national comedy club circuit with his sharp\, conversational style and razor-sharp wit. \nKnown for his appearances at top clubs like Goodnights Comedy Club in Raleigh and Wiseguys Comedy Club\, O’Connor delivers a brand of comedy that blends clever wordplay with honest\, relatable storytelling. His material covers everything from everyday awkwardness to deeper observations about modern life. \nWith a growing fanbase and a packed 2026 tour schedule\, Chris O’Connor is one of the most exciting names to watch in stand-up comedy right now. Don’t miss your chance to see him live in Houston. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, located at 1204 Caroline Street in the heart of the city. This Live Nation-operated club brings world-class comedians to an intimate\, energetic setting that makes every show feel personal. \nThe venue features a general admission floor with preferred seating upgrades available. Every seat offers a great sightline to the stage\, and the full-service bar ensures you’re well-stocked for a night of laughs. The 2-beverage minimum per person is standard at this club. \nParking options include valet service (available at most shows) and the nearby Green Street garage on Clay between Main and Fannin\, which offers skybridge access to the venue. The club is cashless — credit and debit cards only. \nWhat to Expect\nFriday night at Punch Line Houston is always a great time\, and Chris O’Connor’s early show is the perfect way to start your weekend. Expect a tight\, polished set filled with clever observations\, audience interaction\, and genuine laughs from start to finish. \nDoors open one hour before showtime\, so plan to arrive early to get settled and order your first round. The show runs approximately 90 minutes. A late show at 9:15 PM is also available for those who prefer a later start. \nCell phones\, video recording\, and photography are not permitted during the performance. The venue enforces a strict no-heckling policy to ensure the best experience for all guests. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $38 to $50 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale options on VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chris-oconnor-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/740/8304a332-325a-401d-a8c5-c85ee6fcd740_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
GEO:29.7533552;-95.3641123
