SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at PPG Paints Arena
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Nate Bargatze\nNate Bargatze is the #1 earning comedian in the world according to Pollstar\, and he holds the record for the biggest one-year gross by a comedy performer in history. \nA Grammy Award winner and Emmy-nominated comedian\, Nate hosted the 77th Primetime Emmy Awards on CBS — the highest-rated Emmys in four years. His Netflix special Your Friend\, Nate Bargatze was in the global top 10 for two weeks and won the Grammy for Best Comedy Album. \nHe is also a New York Times #1 bestselling author\, a game show host on ABC/Hulu\, and stars in the Sony Pictures comedy The Breadwinner. His clean\, relatable humor about family\, marriage\, and everyday life has made him one of the most beloved comedians of his generation. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Ave\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15219\nTour: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour\nShow Duration: Approximately 2 hours (including openers) \nAbout the Venue\nPPG Paints Arena is Pittsburgh’s premier indoor arena\, home to the Pittsburgh Penguins and one of the top entertainment venues in the region. \nThe arena seats approximately 18\,387 guests for concerts and comedy events\, with multiple seating tiers offering excellent sightlines from every section. Concessions\, bars\, and premium club areas are available throughout the venue. \nParking is available in multiple garages surrounding the arena. The venue is easily accessible via I-376 and is steps from the Pittsburgh Light Rail system. Arrive early to beat the crowds and find your seats. \nWhat to Expect\nNate Bargatze’s Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is a full arena comedy experience — polished\, hilarious\, and completely family-friendly. \nExpect multiple opening acts before Nate takes the stage for his headline set. His storytelling about his family\, his dad\, and the absurdity of everyday life is delivered with perfect timing and genuine warmth. \nThis is one of the hottest comedy tickets of 2026 — Nate has been breaking venue attendance records across the country on this tour. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $49 – $150 depending on seating and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-ppg-paints-arena/
LOCATION:PPG Paints Arena\, 1001 Fifth Avenue\, Pittsburgh\, Pennsylvania\, 15219\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://prismic-images.tmol.io/ticketmaster-tm-global/aY-tyVWLo0XkEgrB_EADP-Desktop-Header-NateBargatze.png?auto=format,compress&rect=594,0,1238,1023&w=375&h=310
