SUMMARY:Pat McGann LIVE at Birchmere
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nPat McGann LIVE at Birchmere\nOne of comedy’s fastest-rising stars\, Pat McGann\, is coming to the legendary Birchmere in Alexandria\, VA for a night of hilarious stand-up comedy! Known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and infectious energy\, Pat McGann delivers a show that will have the whole room laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM ET (Doors open at 6:00 PM\, Seating begins at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Birchmere\nAddress: 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA 22305\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nParking: Plenty of free\, secure on-site parking available \nAbout Pat McGann\nPat McGann is a Chicago-based comedian who has quickly risen through the ranks to become one of the most talked-about voices in stand-up comedy. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon and has toured extensively across the country\, earning rave reviews for his sharp\, self-deprecating humor and hilarious takes on family life and everyday situations. His debut album debuted at #1 on the iTunes comedy charts. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, witty stand-up comedy from one of the hottest rising stars in the game\nHilarious storytelling about family\, relationships\, and everyday life\nAn intimate\, world-class comedy experience at the legendary Birchmere\nSelf-deprecating humor that is both relatable and brilliantly crafted\nA perfect summer night out with friends or a date\nAn evening you’ll be quoting and laughing about for weeks to come\n\nVenue Information\nThe Birchmere is America’s legendary music hall\, a beloved 500-seat intimate venue in Alexandria\, Virginia\, established in 1966. Known for its exceptional sound quality\, comfortable seating\, and warm atmosphere\, the Birchmere is one of the most cherished entertainment venues in the DC metro area. \nTicket Information\nTickets are $45 (face value) with service fees through Ticketmaster at $58.95\, or $52 at the Birchmere Box Office. Tickets are limited — only 30 remaining on VividSeats — so grab yours before they’re gone! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/pat-mcgann-live-at-birchmere/
LOCATION:Birchmere\, 3701 Mt. Vernon Ave\, Alexandria\, VA\, 22305\, United States
