SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Palace Theatre Columbus (Late Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Josh Johnson\nJosh Johnson is one of the most exciting comedians in the game right now. With over 10 million followers across social media\, WIRED called him “the funniest guy on the internet.” He is an Emmy-nominated writer\, stand-up comedian\, actor\, and NAACP award-winner from Louisiana by way of Chicago. \nJohnson is currently a rotating host and correspondent on Comedy Central’s Emmy and Peabody Award-winning program The Daily Show. He is also a prolific creator who puts out weekly stand-up sets on his YouTube channel — content that has been viewed over half a billion times worldwide. In 2025\, he released an astonishing 38 hours of topical stand-up material performed in front of live audiences. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 10:00 PM (Late Show)\nVenue: Palace Theatre Columbus\nAddress: 34 W. Broad St.\, Columbus\, OH 43215\nTicket Price Range: Starting at $91+\nNote: Two shows available this night — 7:00 PM (Early) and 10:00 PM (Late)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Palace Theatre Columbus is a magnificent historic venue located at 34 W. Broad St. in the heart of downtown Columbus. Built in 1926\, this stunning theater is one of the most beautiful performance spaces in Ohio\, featuring ornate architecture\, a grand lobby\, and exceptional acoustics. \nOperated by CAPA (Columbus Association for the Performing Arts)\, the Palace Theatre seats approximately 2\,800 guests and offers a truly special atmosphere for live entertainment. The venue’s classic design creates an intimate feel despite its size\, with excellent sightlines from all seating areas. The Palace is easily accessible from throughout Columbus and is surrounded by downtown dining and entertainment options. \nParking is available in several nearby garages and surface lots in downtown Columbus. The venue is also accessible via COTA bus routes. Arrive early to take in the stunning architecture and grab a drink before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp is a unique and innovative comedy experience that goes beyond a traditional stand-up show. The late show at 10:00 PM is perfect for night owls who want to experience Josh’s signature topical humor\, sharp social commentary\, and intelligent comedy in a more intimate late-night atmosphere. \nThe show incorporates musical elements and a full cast of performers\, creating an immersive entertainment experience unlike anything else on tour. Fans who have followed Josh on The Daily Show or his YouTube channel will recognize his ability to make sense of the world through humor — but seeing it live takes the experience to a whole new level. \nThe late show tends to have a more energetic\, electric atmosphere as the night crowd brings extra enthusiasm. Doors typically open 30-60 minutes before showtime. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $91 and are available through CAPA/Ticketmaster and VividSeats. Josh Johnson shows have been selling out across the country — grab your tickets now! \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-palace-theatre-columbus-late-show/
LOCATION:Palace Theatre Columbus\, 34 W. Broad St.\, Columbus\, OH\, 43215\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/a1f/6aec4b02-7063-4485-bcc9-242f0eef6a1f_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
