SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Taft Theatre (Early Show)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n \nAbout the Performer\nJosh Johnson is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for his sharp wit\, absurdist observations\, and uniquely cerebral comedic style. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, The Daily Show\, and his own Netflix special\, earning him a devoted fanbase across the country. \nJohnson’s comedy blends intellectual humor with relatable everyday experiences\, often exploring the quirks of modern life\, social dynamics\, and the human condition — all delivered with impeccable timing and a laid-back confidence that keeps audiences laughing from start to finish. \nHis Comedy Band Camp concept is a unique live experience that combines stand-up performance with a musical\, camp-style atmosphere — making it one of the most talked-about touring shows of 2026. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 5:00 PM (Early Show)\nVenue: Taft Theatre\, 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, OH 45202\nDoors Open: Approximately 4:00 PM\nAge Restrictions: All ages welcome; some content may be intended for mature audiences\nNote: A second show (Late Show) is also available at 8:30 PM on the same date\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Taft Theatre is one of Cincinnati’s most beloved and historic entertainment venues\, located in the heart of downtown at 317 East 5th Street. Built in 1928\, the Taft Theatre is a stunning example of Art Deco architecture and has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy\, music\, and the performing arts for nearly a century. \nWith a seating capacity of approximately 2\,500\, the Taft offers an intimate yet grand atmosphere that makes every seat feel close to the action. The venue features excellent sightlines\, superior acoustics\, and a warm\, classic ambiance that enhances any live performance experience. \nAmenities include a full-service bar\, concessions\, and accessible seating options. Parking is available in several nearby garages and surface lots throughout downtown Cincinnati. The venue is also conveniently accessible via public transit. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp is not your average stand-up show. This unique live experience brings together comedy\, music\, and an immersive camp-style atmosphere that has been wowing audiences on tour across the country. \nExpect a high-energy evening filled with Josh Johnson’s signature brand of smart\, observational humor\, along with special musical elements that make this show a one-of-a-kind event. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Josh Johnson for the first time\, this show promises to be an unforgettable night of laughter and entertainment. \nThe Early Show at 5:00 PM is perfect for those who want to enjoy the full experience and still have the rest of the evening free. Arrive early to grab a drink\, find your seat\, and soak in the incredible atmosphere of the historic Taft Theatre. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Josh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp (Early Show) at Taft Theatre start from approximately $89\, with premium options available at higher price points. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale marketplace). \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-taft-theatre-early-show/
LOCATION:Taft Theatre\, 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, Ohio\, 45202\, United States
