utes of clean\, hilarious comedy that the whole family can enjoy. Bargatze’s storytelling style draws you in from the first minute and keeps you laughing until the very end. \nThis is the evening show at 7:00 PM. A matinee show at 3:00 PM is also available on the same day. Arrive early to find your seats and enjoy the arena atmosphere before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: Starting from $57 (fees may apply) \nSecure your seats through the official Ticketmaster link or find resale tickets through VividSeats for flexible options. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
