SUMMARY:Tumua LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\nAbout Tumua\nTumua Tuinei is a stand-up comedian\, podcaster\, former collegiate athlete\, actor\, and social media personality born and raised on the island of Oahu\, Hawaii. With over 600\,000 combined followers across Instagram\, Facebook\, TikTok\, and YouTube\, Tumua has become one of the most beloved voices in Pacific Islander comedy. \nHis comedy is deeply rooted in his Polynesian heritage\, family life\, and the everyday experiences of growing up in Hawaii. Tumua’s relatable humor\, infectious energy\, and masterful crowd work have earned him a devoted fanbase that spans the globe. In 2023 alone\, he performed in 22 cities\, 11 states\, and 5 islands — a testament to his rapidly growing popularity. \nKnown for his high-energy performances and ability to connect with audiences of all backgrounds\, Tumua delivers a show that is equal parts hilarious and heartfelt. Fans consistently rave about his crowd interactions and his ability to make every show feel personal and unique. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open one hour before the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-beverage minimum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most iconic comedy clubs on the West Coast\, located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. With a capacity of approximately 300 guests\, the club offers an intimate setting where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The layout is a classic comedy club setup with tiered seating\, ensuring excellent sightlines from every angle. Parking is available in the surrounding area\, and the club is easily accessible from major Sacramento thoroughfares. \nPunch Line Sacramento has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and is known for its warm\, welcoming atmosphere and top-notch sound system. Whether you’re a first-timer or a regular\, the Punch Line delivers a world-class comedy experience every night. \nWhat to Expect\nTumua’s live show is a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud experience from start to finish. Expect plenty of crowd work\, personal stories about his Hawaiian upbringing\, family life\, and the unique experience of being a Polynesian comedian navigating the mainland comedy circuit. \nThe show typically runs approximately 90 minutes and features an opening act before Tumua takes the stage. Audience members are encouraged to arrive early to grab drinks and get settled before the show begins. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $65 (includes fees) \nPurchase official tickets directly through Ticketmaster\, or find resale tickets through VividSeats for flexible options including quantity selection. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tumua-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/15a/6f2efe8b-c990-4232-992e-26ff0002515a_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg
