SUMMARY:Kevin Nealon LIVE at The Wilbur
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nKevin Nealon is one of the most beloved comedians and entertainers in America. Best known as a cast member of Saturday Night Live for nine seasons\, Kevin became a household name through his iconic characters and Weekend Update anchor role. He later starred as Doug Wilson in the hit Showtime series Weeds for eight seasons\, cementing his status as one of comedy’s most versatile talents. \nKevin’s stand-up is sharp\, observational\, and brilliantly crafted — the kind of comedy that feels effortless and natural while delivering laugh after laugh. His live shows are warm\, engaging\, and packed with the kind of material that only comes from decades of experience at the top of the comedy world. \nSeeing Kevin Nealon live at The Wilbur is a rare opportunity to experience one of comedy’s true legends up close and personal. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nTickets from: $45\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved and intimate comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theater District at 246 Tremont Street. With a capacity of approximately 1\,000 guests\, The Wilbur offers an up-close and personal experience that is perfect for Kevin’s warm and conversational performance style. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, historic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Originally built in 1914\, The Wilbur has been lovingly restored and is now one of the premier comedy destinations on the East Coast. \nParking is available at nearby garages in the Theater District\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines at Boylston and Back Bay stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a hilarious\, warm\, and thoroughly entertaining evening of stand-up comedy as Kevin Nealon takes the stage at The Wilbur. This is a solo performance showcasing Kevin’s signature blend of observational humor\, personal storytelling\, and the kind of effortless comedic timing that has made him one of the most respected performers in the business. \nSuitable for audiences 16 and older. A perfect summer night out for fans of classic\, brilliantly crafted stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets from $45. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets via VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/7b3/c51ac6c7-c9ac-4bbb-bbb1-a0c9e19c57b3_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
