SUMMARY:Cristela Alonzo: The Midlife Mixtape Tour LIVE at Brea Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nCristela Alonzo: The Midlife Mixtape Tour LIVE at Brea Improv\nHistoric comedian and actress Cristela Alonzo brings her “Midlife Mixtape Tour” to the Brea Improv for a weekend run of shows in August 2026. \nThe first Latina to create\, produce\, and star in her own network sitcom\, Cristela Alonzo is a trailblazer in comedy and entertainment. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbout Cristela Alonzo\nCristela Alonzo is a comedian\, actress\, and writer who became the first Latina to create\, produce\, and star in her own network sitcom with ABC’s Cristela. She is also known for voicing Cruz Ramirez in Pixar’s Cars 3 and has released stand-up specials on Netflix. Her comedy draws from her experiences growing up in a Mexican-American family on the Texas-Mexico border. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up about midlife\, family\, and cultural identity\nMaterial from her acclaimed Netflix specials\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\nMultiple show times available Saturday and Sunday\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/cristela-alonzo-the-midlife-mixtape-tour-live-at-brea-improv/
LOCATION:Brea Improv\, 180 South Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA\, 92821\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/44_Edp-Nq5zyv.png
