SUMMARY:Rocky Dale Davis LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nRocky Dale Davis LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nViral comedian Rocky Dale Davis brings his high-energy stand-up to Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club at The LINQ on the Las Vegas Strip on August 1\, 2026. With over 500 million views on TikTok and Instagram\, Rocky Dale Davis is one of the hottest rising stars in comedy — and this is your chance to see him live! \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PT (9:30 PM show also available)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (at The LINQ Promenade)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lot \nAbout Rocky Dale Davis\nRocky Dale Davis is a stand-up comedian whose viral videos on TikTok and Instagram have amassed over 500 million views and 1 million followers. Known for his relatable\, high-energy humor\, Rocky has appeared on E!’s Dating No Filter and NBC’s Bring The Funny\, and is quickly becoming one of the most talked-about comedians in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-up set by Rocky Dale Davis\nHigh-energy\, viral-style comedy\nIntimate showroom setting at The LINQ Promenade\n18+ show with adult humor\nMultiple show times available (7:30 PM & 9:30 PM)\nOne of TikTok’s most-watched comedians live on stage\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at The LINQ Promenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate and lively comedy experience steps away from the High Roller observation wheel and some of Vegas’s best dining and entertainment. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $62. Must be 18 and older to attend. Bags are subject to search upon entry. Reserved seats are subject to change if you arrive 15 minutes after the show begins. There is a 20-ticket limit per order. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
