SUMMARY:Max Amini LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nMax Amini is one of the most exciting and fastest-rising comedians in the world — a world-renowned stand-up comedian\, producer\, director\, and podcaster who has redefined what it means to be a global comedy star in the digital age. Born in Tucson\, Arizona\, and raised with Iranian heritage\, Max has built a comedy empire from the ground up\, amassing over 25.7 million followers and an astonishing 5.8 billion views in 2025 alone\, making him the most-watched comedian on Instagram globally. \nMax made history as the first Iranian-American artist to headline Madison Square Garden and sell out the Kia Forum in Los Angeles. His 2025 tour spanned 19 countries\, 60 cities\, and 150 sold-out shows\, with over 200\,000 tickets sold. His stand-up special Randomly Selected reached 16 million views in under six months. Known for his brilliant crowd work\, cultural storytelling\, and magnetic stage presence\, Max calls his live shows a “United Nations of Comedy” — bringing audiences of all backgrounds together for an unforgettable night of laughter. \nThis one-night-only performance at the Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is a rare chance to see one of comedy’s biggest global stars up close in an intimate Las Vegas setting. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\nAddress: 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nNote: One night only. Meet & Greet VIP packages available.\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most intimate and prestigious entertainment venues on the Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the luxurious Wynn Las Vegas resort at 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, the Encore Theater seats approximately 1\,600 guests and is celebrated for its exceptional acoustics\, elegant design\, and the up-close\, personal atmosphere it creates for every performance. \nThe Encore Theater has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and entertainment\, including Sebastian Maniscalco\, Jerry Seinfeld\, Jimmy Carr\, and now Max Amini. Its intimate layout ensures that every seat feels close to the stage — making it one of the best venues in Las Vegas for a stand-up comedy show. \nValet and self-parking are available at Wynn Las Vegas. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Max Amini show into a full luxury Las Vegas evening. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Max Amini — one night only at the Encore Theater. Expect a high-energy\, crowd-interactive show packed with Max’s signature cultural storytelling\, brilliant improvisation\, and the kind of universal humor that has made him a global phenomenon. Max is famous for his incredible crowd work — no two shows are ever the same. \nVIP Meet & Greet packages are available for fans who want to meet Max after the show. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is a show that will leave you laughing and wanting more. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $75 – $200 \nTickets available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). VIP Meet & Greet packages also available. Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/max-amini-live-encore-theater-wynn-las-vegas-august/
LOCATION:Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\, 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
