SUMMARY:Jo Koy Live LIVE at Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJo Koy Live LIVE at Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of laughter as Jo Koy brings his high-energy stand-up comedy show to The Showroom at Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass in Chandler\, Arizona on Saturday\, August 1\, 2026. One of the most beloved comedians in the world\, Jo Koy delivers a hilarious\, heartfelt performance that has sold out arenas across the globe. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open earlier)\nVenue: Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass (The Showroom)\nAddress: 5040 Wild Horse Pass Blvd\, Chandler\, AZ 85226\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available on-site at the resort \nAbout Jo Koy\nJo Koy is one of today’s premier stand-up comedians\, known for his hilarious and heartfelt storytelling about his Filipino-American family and upbringing. He has sold out arenas worldwide\, released multiple Netflix specials\, and is beloved by millions of fans for his relatable humor and infectious energy. His tours consistently rank among the top-grossing comedy tours in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from one of the world’s top comedians\nHilarious stories about family\, culture\, and everyday life\nAn intimate showroom setting at a world-class resort casino\nA night of non-stop laughter with a live audience\nMemorable performances that fans rave about for years\n18+ event at one of the Phoenix area’s premier entertainment venues\n\nVenue Information\nGila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass is a premier entertainment destination located at 5040 Wild Horse Pass Blvd in Chandler\, AZ. The Showroom is an intimate\, state-of-the-art venue offering excellent sightlines and top-notch amenities\, making it one of the best places to catch live comedy in the Phoenix metro area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $153. Secure your seats now before they sell out – Jo Koy shows are known to sell out quickly! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
